220 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 127 0 R/E(Christian Center of Park City\220s mission is \215Meeting people at their point of need as an expression of God\220s love.\216 We see our new store not merely as an affordable retail outlet, but as a vibrant hub where individuals come to inspire, connect, and create positive change. Christian )/Pg 13 0 R/K[6]>>
