221 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 127 0 R/E(Center of Park City\220s organizational vision is to have a community where every person is met at their point of need. This new store location is another step to help CCPC accomplish this vision. It will serve as a catalyst for fostering a sense of belonging, purpose, and hope within the local community. As part of our vision, this store and the CCPC stores will be at the Outlets Park City to fund our community outreach programs. )/Pg 13 0 R/K[7]>>
